sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Client as Client app
  participant API as Protected API
  participant IDP as Identity provider
  User->>Client: Open account
  Client->>API: Request with access token
  API-->>Client: 401 token expired
  alt access token expired; refresh token valid
    Client->>IDP: Refresh token
    IDP-->>Client: New access token
    Client->>API: Retry once
  end
  API-->>Client: Account data
  Client-->>User: Show account
